<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel says 9-month net up 27 percent.</title>
<headline>Piltel says 9-month net up 27 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilipino Telephone Corp posted a 27 percent increase in net income in the first nine months of the year to 722.4 million pesos, an official of the company told Reuters on Monday.</p>
</text>
